WEBVTT

00:01.860 --> 00:07.240
Nanasaki said she was fine with
being unable to go to the swim meet,

00:07.240 --> 00:09.280
but I'm sure it was still a shock to her.

00:09.820 --> 00:14.040
All right, I think I'll cheer her up a little!

00:14.910 --> 00:19.920
Amagami SS

00:14.910 --> 00:19.920
Nanasaki Ai Chapter

00:20.290 --> 00:22.920
Eh?  You have something to talk about?

00:23.130 --> 00:24.050
Yeah.

00:24.050 --> 00:28.340
I was wondering if you have some time after school or after practice.

00:30.430 --> 00:32.600
Yes, sure.

00:36.270 --> 00:38.020
It's pretty cold.

00:38.020 --> 00:40.230
It's already December, after all.

00:42.480 --> 00:45.780
This canned coffee you gave me is really warm.

00:47.190 --> 00:48.610
That's good.

00:53.530 --> 00:56.290
Senpai, do you remember what happened here?

00:56.830 --> 00:59.460
Yeah, I do.

00:59.460 --> 01:00.920
I was looking for Pooh, and-

01:01.250 --> 01:05.090
You were peeking up my skirt.

01:05.090 --> 01:07.010
I-I wasn't!

01:07.010 --> 01:09.590
Didn't you lift up your skirt yourself?

01:09.590 --> 01:10.970
Did I now?

01:10.970 --> 01:12.180
You did!

01:12.180 --> 01:13.430
Seriously...

01:20.140 --> 01:24.150
I wonder if she's feeling down after all
from being unable to go to the swim meet.

01:24.860 --> 01:28.940
All right, I've got to cheer her up!

01:29.400 --> 01:31.030
You know, Nanasaki...

01:31.030 --> 01:32.910
Yes?  What is it?

01:33.660 --> 01:35.330
Isn't that Pooh?

01:36.580 --> 01:37.740
Where?

01:38.660 --> 01:39.950
Pooh?

01:42.790 --> 01:43.330
Now!

01:44.920 --> 01:48.170
S-Senpai?  What are you doing?!

01:48.170 --> 01:52.130
Isn't it obvious?  I'm putting my hands into your skirt pockets.

01:56.800 --> 01:58.560
I know that.

01:58.560 --> 01:59.350
Yeah.

01:59.350 --> 02:03.730
And I'm asking you why my skirt pockets.

02:03.730 --> 02:06.900
It's uh... skinship!

02:09.650 --> 02:12.610
You can't call this skinship.

02:13.280 --> 02:18.370
Skinship is a word primarily used between mother and child.

02:18.370 --> 02:19.740
Really?

02:20.700 --> 02:23.000
Take your hands out if you understand.

02:23.540 --> 02:26.170
This is really embarrassing, you know.

02:27.340 --> 02:29.340
But you know...

02:29.750 --> 02:33.630
The inside of your pocket's a lot warmer than I'd thought...

02:33.630 --> 02:35.010
It feels good...

02:36.510 --> 02:37.930
S-Senpai!

02:37.930 --> 02:40.310
P-Please don't move your hands.

02:40.310 --> 02:41.560
It tickles!

02:43.350 --> 02:46.230
Don't laugh!  Take your hands out!

02:46.230 --> 02:48.150
I'm not sure I want to...

02:49.860 --> 02:51.780
Hey, Senpai!

02:51.780 --> 02:52.400
What?

02:52.400 --> 02:55.360
I'm doing my groceries at the supermarket after this.

02:55.360 --> 03:02.750
I have to make dinner for Ikuo, and take in and
fold the laundry before my mom returns from work.

03:02.750 --> 03:05.040
Oh, is that so?

03:05.040 --> 03:07.420
So please take your hands out now.

03:07.420 --> 03:08.920
Well, uh...

03:08.920 --> 03:12.090
I'll go grocery shopping with you, then.

03:13.340 --> 03:15.720
I want to be with you a little longer.

03:19.510 --> 03:21.260
Looks like I have no choice.

03:21.260 --> 03:22.890
Then, just like this...

03:22.890 --> 03:24.600
Yeah, just like this.

03:25.440 --> 03:27.560
Then, here I go!

03:27.560 --> 03:29.110
Ouch!

03:29.860 --> 03:31.400
Ow...

03:31.730 --> 03:34.610
Come on, Senpai.  Let's go.

03:35.990 --> 03:39.570
W-Wait, Nanasaki!

03:41.950 --> 03:45.910
Today, it's only one pack of eggs per person for 100 yen,

03:45.910 --> 03:47.120
so help me out, okay?

03:47.120 --> 03:48.830
Sure, you can count on me.

03:48.830 --> 03:53.630
The vegetables are really cheap in the supermarket at the 3rd District, so we'll go there after this.

03:53.630 --> 03:56.510
And the fish store at the 5th District is doing a promotion,

03:56.510 --> 04:00.090
so I think I'll get some amberjack fillets and some sashimi for my dad's sake.

04:00.090 --> 04:00.760
Then I'll...

04:00.760 --> 04:03.010
H-How much are you gonna buy?

04:03.010 --> 04:05.060
It's not everyday that I have you with me,

04:05.060 --> 04:08.230
so I was thinking of buying a week's worth of groceries.

04:08.230 --> 04:10.480
Please go easy on me.

04:11.440 --> 04:14.570
Come on.  Hurry up.  Let's go, Senpai.

04:14.860 --> 04:16.820
Wait for me, Nanasaki!

04:18.490 --> 04:20.030
I'm glad.

04:20.030 --> 04:22.700
It looks like she's feeling a little happier.

04:27.250 --> 04:32.250
Amagami SS

04:27.250 --> 04:32.250
Sakurai Rihoko Chapter

04:38.970 --> 04:43.220
Yet another day passed by peacefully, Junichi!

04:43.470 --> 04:49.140
I have a new club member, and I think I'm
getting used to my duties as club president!

04:51.690 --> 04:53.730
A little <i>too peaceful for my liking.</i>

04:54.110 --> 04:55.860
Huh?  Why?

04:55.860 --> 04:57.240
Is something wrong?

04:57.530 --> 05:00.110
Rihoko.  You got fatter, didn't you?

05:00.860 --> 05:02.450
How did you know?

05:03.410 --> 05:05.030
I could tell just from looking at you.

05:05.030 --> 05:07.120
I guess you're right.

05:07.120 --> 05:11.040
With my worries gone, I just ate what I wanted.

05:11.040 --> 05:14.170
Weren't you trying to go on a diet before?

05:14.170 --> 05:16.090
You're right, but...

05:16.340 --> 05:19.470
Well, this isn't any different from usual.

05:19.970 --> 05:22.470
Junichi, you dropped something.

05:23.510 --> 05:24.970
A nail clipper?

05:24.970 --> 05:27.430
It's not your typical nail clipper.

05:27.430 --> 05:30.850
It's the latest model NASA made using the newest materials!

05:30.850 --> 05:32.100
Really?!

05:32.100 --> 05:33.980
That sounds amazing!

05:33.980 --> 05:34.770
I know, right?

05:34.770 --> 05:36.690
I've been wanting to show it to somebody.

05:37.280 --> 05:39.400
I totally know what you mean!

05:39.400 --> 05:40.240
I know!

05:40.240 --> 05:42.860
Lemme cut your nails.

05:44.370 --> 05:48.200
I don't mind, but what about your own nails?

05:48.200 --> 05:51.710
As you can see, I've already cut them.

05:51.710 --> 05:53.080
I see...

05:53.080 --> 05:54.250
Well, okay.

05:54.630 --> 05:56.250
All right.

05:59.960 --> 06:01.880
What are you doing, Rihoko?

06:02.260 --> 06:04.140
I'm taking my socks off.

06:04.140 --> 06:06.760
Didn't you say you'd cut my nails?

06:06.760 --> 06:09.390
Yeah, so why are you taking your socks off?

06:11.100 --> 06:15.060
Well, I already cut the nails on my hands.

06:15.560 --> 06:17.730
So that's why.

06:18.360 --> 06:20.110
You don't want to since it's my feet?

06:20.110 --> 06:22.780
I-I don't really mind...

06:23.650 --> 06:24.780
That's good.

06:24.780 --> 06:26.570
Then, please go ahead.

06:27.870 --> 06:29.830
Don't hurt me, okay?

06:29.830 --> 06:31.790
O-Okay.

06:33.000 --> 06:38.000
I guess it's kinda embarrassing to have Junichi cut my nails for me.

06:39.250 --> 06:44.630
This position isn't very proper, but it should make cutting them easier.

06:44.630 --> 06:47.140
Well then, please!

06:47.140 --> 06:48.050
Yeah.

06:51.600 --> 06:52.930
What?

06:52.930 --> 06:57.400
T-That was a little ticklish...

06:57.940 --> 06:59.770
S-Sorry.

07:00.230 --> 07:03.240
My heartbeat's speeding up...

07:03.740 --> 07:06.570
Well, here I go.

07:08.450 --> 07:10.080
Did that hurt?

07:10.080 --> 07:13.370
No, it didn't.  It was just...

07:14.500 --> 07:15.710
Just what?

07:15.710 --> 07:20.250
I was just thinking that it's pretty nice to have someone else cut your nails.

07:20.250 --> 07:21.710
Really?

07:21.710 --> 07:24.090
Yeah, I feel like a queen.

07:24.090 --> 07:27.720
Hey now, don't you mean a princess?

07:27.720 --> 07:29.850
Oh yeah, that's what I meant.

07:30.890 --> 07:32.930
You're good at this.

07:33.810 --> 07:36.890
Why don't you become a professional nail clipper?

07:36.890 --> 07:39.150
Does that profession even exist?

07:40.610 --> 07:43.530
I don't know if it does or not.

07:43.530 --> 07:45.280
Don't tell me you want to look for it.

07:45.280 --> 07:47.240
Of course it doesn't exist.

07:48.740 --> 07:52.450
Clip, clip!  Nail clipper, clip!

07:52.450 --> 07:56.960
It's embarrassing, so don't stare at me like that!

07:56.960 --> 07:58.170
What the heck's that?

07:58.170 --> 07:59.580
A major festival song.

07:59.580 --> 08:02.170
That song can't be it, no matter how you cut it.

08:03.130 --> 08:04.760
Is that so?

08:05.630 --> 08:06.970
Yeah.

08:17.100 --> 08:19.980
I-I didn't look, okay?

08:22.610 --> 08:24.980
Geez!  Junichi, you pervert!

08:25.280 --> 08:27.780
I said I didn't look!

08:27.780 --> 08:29.530
Really?

08:29.530 --> 08:31.240
Really.

08:31.240 --> 08:32.990
You'll get hurt if you don't stay still.

08:38.830 --> 08:40.210
And we're done!

08:40.960 --> 08:43.960
It felt a lot better than I'd expected.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.090
Yeah, right?

08:45.090 --> 08:49.010
Clip, clip!  Nail clipper, clip!

08:49.010 --> 08:53.510
My nails are cut, and my toes are happy!

08:53.510 --> 08:56.180
Why are you singing again?

09:02.520 --> 09:07.530
Amagami SS

09:07.530 --> 09:07.570
City where the world looks round

09:07.530 --> 09:07.570
Welcome to the city by the sea

09:07.530 --> 09:07.570
Kibitou  University

09:11.450 --> 09:14.370
That's because your typing is really slow.

09:15.120 --> 09:18.250
But don't you think I've gotten a little faster?

09:18.250 --> 09:22.500
I suppose, but there isn't much time left until the Founder's Festival.

09:22.500 --> 09:24.130
Take it seriously.

09:24.130 --> 09:27.090
I know, Committee President.

09:28.050 --> 09:30.220
Oh?  This smell...

09:30.220 --> 09:31.680
Hmm?  What is it?

09:31.680 --> 09:34.010
You didn't notice this sweet smell in the air?

09:35.390 --> 09:36.760
Oh, you're right.

09:36.760 --> 09:38.060
How slow.

09:38.060 --> 09:40.430
You should pay more attention to your surroundings.

09:40.430 --> 09:44.940
That's why the number of mistakes you make doing committee work aren't decreasing.

09:45.610 --> 09:49.820
Ah, it must be that melon bread food van over there.

09:49.820 --> 09:51.110
You avoided the subject.

09:52.320 --> 09:54.160
I've heard about it from Miya.

09:54.160 --> 09:56.450
She says you can buy freshly-baked bread there.

09:56.450 --> 09:58.450
They're really good, apparently.

10:01.210 --> 10:03.420
Do you want me to buy some?

10:03.420 --> 10:05.290
No, it's fine.

10:05.290 --> 10:07.840
Just wait here for a bit, Tachibana-kun.

10:14.430 --> 10:15.470
I'm back.

10:15.720 --> 10:17.850
Hello agai... wha-?!

10:18.640 --> 10:22.020
What's with that heap of melon bread, Ayatsuji-san?!

10:22.730 --> 10:24.940
I got them for free!

10:24.940 --> 10:26.310
For free?!

10:26.310 --> 10:30.360
I only asked for two, but the man said I could have all these.

10:31.820 --> 10:33.320
Don't tell me...

10:33.320 --> 10:34.780
Thank you!

10:38.950 --> 10:40.200
I think we're done here.

10:40.490 --> 10:43.370
As I thought, it was all just an act.

10:44.460 --> 10:46.540
What's with that look?

10:47.380 --> 10:49.210
Nothing.

10:50.590 --> 10:51.880
Well, whatever.

10:51.880 --> 10:53.970
Let's eat them while they're still hot.

10:55.010 --> 10:57.010
I'm digging in!

10:57.010 --> 11:02.180
Um, my hands are occupied so I can't eat...

11:02.180 --> 11:04.020
Then don't eat.

11:04.940 --> 11:06.350
Just kidding.

11:06.350 --> 11:08.270
I'll feed you.

11:08.270 --> 11:09.320
Really?

11:09.320 --> 11:10.270
Yeah.

11:11.280 --> 11:13.030
Here.  Say, "ahh".

11:14.190 --> 11:15.650
Oh, you don't want any?

11:15.650 --> 11:17.410
I do!  I do!

11:17.410 --> 11:20.410
Then here.  "Ahh".

11:20.990 --> 11:23.790
Mmm!  Delicious!

11:23.790 --> 11:27.920
The outside's all crispy but inside's really chewy!

11:28.210 --> 11:33.630
I knew Ayatsuji-san wouldn't actually feed me, but still...

11:33.960 --> 11:36.300
A-Ayatsuji-san...

11:36.300 --> 11:38.260
Yeah, yeah.  I know.

11:38.260 --> 11:40.430
You can have some this time.

11:43.680 --> 11:46.980
Oh?  The taste really spreads out with the second mouthful!

11:46.980 --> 11:49.190
It's so good!

11:49.190 --> 11:50.650
Ayatsuji-san.

11:50.650 --> 11:51.690
What?

11:51.690 --> 11:54.190
You're really mean, aren't you?

11:54.570 --> 11:56.990
Oh, you just realized?

11:58.160 --> 12:00.070
Don't make that face.

12:00.070 --> 12:01.200
Here, have this.

12:06.660 --> 12:07.750
This is...

12:07.750 --> 12:09.710
See?  Isn't it delicious?

12:09.710 --> 12:12.710
Yeah, it's really delicious!  It's like...

12:12.710 --> 12:13.710
Here.  "Ahh".

12:13.710 --> 12:15.710
I haven't swallowed yet...

12:15.710 --> 12:16.840
Just eat it.

12:16.840 --> 12:18.630
Come on, open your mouth.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.970
Didn't you just feed me a piece-

12:19.970 --> 12:22.180
Open your mouth.

12:25.720 --> 12:33.320
Delicious
Melon Bread

12:25.720 --> 12:33.320
Natural Taste
with Plenty
of Juice

12:25.720 --> 12:33.320
The All-New
Melon Cream!

12:27.480 --> 12:30.020
There's still a lot left!

12:30.400 --> 12:33.320
You should appreciate the man's kindness.

12:36.530 --> 12:40.160
The melon bread in my mouth should've been sweet,

12:40.160 --> 12:42.530
but it tasted bitter for some reason...

12:43.620 --> 12:45.910
They'll get cold if you don't hurry!

12:45.910 --> 12:48.210
Come on!  Come on, come on, come on!
